    {
      "id": "hard-coded-tunable",
      "description": "SPEC 3.2: no bare numeric literal >= 2 in PHP outside src/Config.php. Exempt: comment lines, lines carrying an HTTP 'status' or 'response' code, array indices ([2]), weekday arithmetic (7), digits inside strings such as dates, colours, formats and regex quantifiers, and a number that is named by a `const` declaration (not bare; the reviewer reads every such const and rejects one that is a tunable).",
